      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This, one of the big issues we have at events is we like to lax the rules later on, the perf gating means we'd have to move to a new instance to do so which has been one of the things putting many larger scale events off using it and just continuing with staff telling people to change",
